Every clinician should assess a patient for a depression with a validated-psychological-instrument.
Every clinician should assess a patient for an anxiety with a validated-psychological-instrument.
Every clinician should assess a patient for a psychological-comorbidity with a validated-psychological-instrument.
If a patient has a depression then every clinician should optimize a depression-treatment for the patient.
If a patient has an anxiety then every clinician should optimize an anxiety-treatment for the patient.
If a patient has a psychological-comorbidity then every clinician should optimize a psychological-comorbidity-treatment for the patient.
